Disabling lifecycle scripts by default by adding `ignore-scripts=true` to your `.npmrc` file is the safest option. If you use packages that rely on lifecycle scripts for legitimate reasons, you can use a plugin like `@lavamoat/allow-scripts` to create an _allowlist_ of packages authorized to run lifecycle scripts.

